  title: { uz: 'Listening: zaif bo\'lim turi 1', en: 'Listening: weak section type 1' },
  intro: { uz: "LC kuni. 5-bosqichda Listening mashqi umumiy emas — 4 mockda eng ko'p ball yo'qotilgan BO'LIM turi (1/2/3/4) ustida. Bugun o'sha bo'lim turi: kitobdan faqat shu turga o'xshash mashqlar.", en: 'LC day. In phase 5 Listening practice is not general — it targets the SECTION type (1/2/3/4) where most marks were lost across four mocks. Today: that section type only — book exercises that resemble it.' },
